OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start for northern parts,
OL,6,Fwith rain then showers in the south.
OL,7,FShowers spreading northwards across
OL,8,Fthe region during the afternoon. Winds
OL,9,Falso strengthening, with coastal gales
OL,10,Flater.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with showers, becoming
OL,13,Fmore settled and drier overnight, with
OL,14,Fclearing skies from the west. Winds
OL,15,Fwill ease slightly by the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
